    "blurb": "Automate financial spreading within workflows",
    "overview": "Automate complex financial spreading by transforming unstructured documents into decision-ready data. This AI-native agent integrates with Camunda to reduce manual workload by 80% with 100% traceability.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "An AI-native solution designed to automate one of the most complex and manual tasks in commercial lending.",
    "splashDescription": "The Taktile Financial Spreading Agent is an AI-native solution designed to automate one of the most complex and manual tasks in commercial lending. By integrating this agent into your Camunda workflows, you can transform messy, unstructured financial documents, such as tax filings, audited statements, and management reports, into standardized, decision-ready financial models in minutes.\n\nUnlike traditional OCR, this agent uses frontier reasoning models to handle complex financial nuances, such as period harmonization, debt reclassification, and interest expense mapping. It is built to operate with human-in-the-loop oversight, providing 100% traceability for every data point extracted.",
